"How could you not pick me?

00:10:08.874 --> 00:10:11.277
People are always saying
I'm as smart as a rock."

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:13.178
[ Laughter ]
Hang on.

00:10:13.178 --> 00:10:14.746
Can we see Dwayne again?

00:10:14.746 --> 00:10:17.183
The guy is jacked.
-Whoo!

00:10:17.183 --> 00:10:18.650
-If you check the tag
on that shirt,

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.420
the size actually says "statue."
[ Laughter ]

